# Proposed Terraform — NOT APPLIED (copy into infra/ when approved)

```hcl
resource "aws_dynamodb_table" "promotion_control" {
  name         = "${local.name_prefix}-promotion-control"
  billing_mode = "PAY_PER_REQUEST"
  hash_key     = "pk"
  range_key    = "sk"

  attribute {
    name = "pk"
    type = "S"
  }
  attribute {
    name = "sk"
    type = "S"
  }

  point_in_time_recovery { enabled = true }

  tags = {
    Purpose = "scoped-holds-and-promotion-grants"
  }
}

# pk = SCOPE#<main_merge|prod_deploy|prod_flags>, sk = META | GRANT#<uuid> | AUDIT#<ulid>
# Conditional updates on generation + hold.active + grant.consume absent
```

IAM for **promotion broker** role only: `dynamodb:UpdateItem`, `GetItem`, `PutItem` on this table.  
GitHub Actions **deploy role must not** receive PutItem on grants; it calls broker `ConsumeGrant` with OIDC.
